{"id":"DEMO101-sample-001","course_code":"DEMO101","schema_version":"1.0","type":"single","stem":{"md":"极限 $\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\dfrac{\\sin 3x}{x}$ 的值为（ ）。","figures":[]},"options":[{"key":"A","md":"$0$"},{"key":"B","md":"$1$"},{"key":"C","md":"$3$"},{"key":"D","md":"$\\dfrac{1}{3}$"}],"answer":{"md":"C（$3$）","figures":[],"origin":"official","origin_detail":"示例题库原创标答"},"solution":{"md":"由重要极限 $\\lim_{u \\to 0} \\dfrac{\\sin u}{u} = 1$，令 $u = 3x$，得 $\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\dfrac{\\sin 3x}{x} = 3 \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\dfrac{\\sin 3x}{3x} = 3$。","steps":["将分母配凑为 $3x$，写为 $3 \\cdot \\dfrac{\\sin 3x}{3x}$。","利用重要极限 $\\lim_{u \\to 0} \\dfrac{\\sin u}{u} = 1$，得结果为 $3$。"],"figures":[]},"tags":{"kp_ids":["demo.limit.calc"],"keywords":["重要极限","等价无穷小"],"difficulty":1},"source":{"kind":"notes","batch":"sample_demo","ref":"示例题库 第 1 题（单选）","year":2026,"term":"2026-2027-1","exam_kind":"quiz","url":null,"rights":"original"},"quality":{"quarantined":false,"quarantine_reason":null,"confidence":1,"note":"注意分子系数不要漏乘。","overlap_hint":null}}
{"id":"DEMO101-sample-002","course_code":"DEMO101","schema_version":"1.0","type":"blank","stem":{"md":"设函数 $f(x) = \\ln(1 + x^2)$，则 $f'(1) =$ ______。","figures":[]},"options":[],"answer":{"md":"$1$","figures":[],"origin":"official","origin_detail":"示例题库原创标答"},"solution":{"md":"由复合函数求导法则得 $f'(x) = \\dfrac{2x}{1 + x^2}$，代入 $x = 1$ 得 $f'(1) = \\dfrac{2}{1 + 1} = 1$。","steps":["对 $f(x) = \\ln(1 + x^2)$ 运用链式法则，得 $f'(x) = \\dfrac{2x}{1 + x^2}$。","将 $x = 1$ 代入导函数，得 $f'(1) = 1$。"],"figures":[]},"tags":{"kp_ids":["demo.calc.deriv"],"keywords":["复合函数求导","对数函数"],"difficulty":2},"source":{"kind":"notes","batch":"sample_demo","ref":"示例题库 第 2 题（填空）","year":2026,"term":"2026-2027-1","exam_kind":"quiz","url":null,"rights":"original"},"quality":{"quarantined":false,"quarantine_reason":null,"confidence":1,"note":null,"overlap_hint":null}}
{"id":"DEMO101-sample-003","course_code":"DEMO101","schema_version":"1.0","type":"solve","stem":{"md":"计算定积分 $I = \\displaystyle\\int_0^1 x\\mathrm{e}^x\\,\\mathrm{d}x$。","figures":[]},"options":[],"answer":{"md":"$1$","figures":[],"origin":"official","origin_detail":"示例题库原创标答"},"solution":{"md":"使用分部积分法，令 $u = x$，$\\mathrm{d}v = \\mathrm{e}^x\\,\\mathrm{d}x$，则 $\\mathrm{d}u = \\mathrm{d}x$，$v = \\mathrm{e}^x$。\\n$$I = \\left. x\\mathrm{e}^x \\right|_0^1 - \\int_0^1 \\mathrm{e}^x\\,\\mathrm{d}x = \\mathrm{e} - (\\mathrm{e} - 1) = 1。$$","steps":["选取 $u = x$，$\\mathrm{d}v = \\mathrm{e}^x\\,\\mathrm{d}x$ 进行分部积分。","化简得 $I = \\left. x\\mathrm{e}^x \\right|_0^1 - \\int_0^1 \\mathrm{e}^x\\,\\mathrm{d}x = \\mathrm{e} - (\\mathrm{e} - 1) = 1$。"],"figures":[]},"tags":{"kp_ids":["demo.calc.integral"],"keywords":["分部积分","定积分"],"difficulty":2},"source":{"kind":"notes","batch":"sample_demo","ref":"示例题库 第 3 题（解答）","year":2026,"term":"2026-2027-1","exam_kind":"final","url":null,"rights":"original"},"quality":{"quarantined":false,"quarantine_reason":null,"confidence":1,"note":"定积分分部积分时不要忘记给首项代上下限。","overlap_hint":null}}
